Z||000003||owenslee||03-25-2001||06:13 PM||||Keith @ Grooms Engines indicated that they are using Hypereutectic pistons in the 3.4 Remanufactured 93-95 Camaro engines they offer. <P>The piston matches the original 9.0:1 compresssion ratio and is part # H800P. This number appears to be a Silvolite number but I do not show it in my catalog and it is not listed on Silvolites web site. However, it may be a recently released item.<P>Can anyone confirm this part number and  source?<P>Kerry<P>------------------<BR>"Badges?...Badges..??? We don gat to sho yu no stinkin' BADGES..!!!"||||reg||1
